    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Adobe is a for-profit public company founded in 1982 and headquartered in San Jose, CA. Its stock trades under the ticker ADBE, and its most recent 10-K filing reported annual revenue of $23,769,000,000 for the period ending November 28, 2025. The company's SEC CIK is 0000796343.\n\nAdobe's AI products span design, video, and audio. Adobe Express is described by the company as an all-in-one design, photo, and video tool for creating social content, videos, and logos, and it incorporates an AI Assistant that the company says allows users to prompt, create, and edit content while preserving chosen elements. Adobe Firefly is the company's image generation model, which Adobe characterizes as trained on commercially safe data. Premiere Pro AI brings generative and color-matching capabilities to professional video editing, also under a commercially safe training claim, and Adobe Podcast AI offers speech enhancement and microphone checking tools with the same training characterization.\n\nNo litigation or MCP server records are held for Adobe in the current dataset.",
